  "project_description": "Account Name rewrites the core \"My account\" menu link so that, instead of the static text, it shows a configurable greeting label plus the current user's username and (optionally) their user picture rendered through a chosen image style. A single admin settings form controls whether the feature is on, the greeting label, the image style, and whether the picture appears before or after the name. It is a small display-only enhancement with no dependencies beyond Drupal core.",
